      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo ali'v'adosya v'aane",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Yakobo wav'itanaga v'ana v'akwe na ku'v'awi'la ati', “Mwikuminge haki'mo, ki'gele mmuwi'le ago galamupandi'ke ku' nsiku' i'zyo zizile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genago hu' magongo iku'mi na av'i'li' ga Izilaeli, na zyeni'zyo hu' mihayo i'zyo Yakobo wav'awi'laga v'ana v'akwe ha itungo lya ku'v'adosya. Wav'adosyaga yu'mo yu'mo, v'ose ki'la yu'mo i'vyo yi'mugelani'lile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ku'fwa kwamwa Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Yakobo walagi'li'zyaga ati', “Ene negelaga ku'fwa mbe haki'mo na v'agu'ku' v'anne. Mulanzyi'ke haki'mo na v'anamala v'anne mu ipilinga i'lo li'li' mu ilale lyamwa Efuloni, Muhiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilale lyeni'lo li'li' ku' Makipela, lwandi' lwa ki'ya ya Mamule, mu nsi' ya Kanaani. Ipilinga lyeni'lo hu' i'lo Abalahamu ndi' wagu'la ku'mwa Efuloni, Muhiti, hav'e ha ku'zyi'ki'la v'antu' v'akwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ipilinga mwenu'mo, v'amuzyi'ki'laga Abalahamu na muki' wakwe Sala, Isaka na muki' wakwe Lebeka, na Leya namuzyi'ki'laga mwenu'mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilale lyeni'lo na ipilinga lyeni'lo lyagu'lilwe ku'fuma ku' V'ahiti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 49:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Yakobo aho wamali'laga ku'v'alanga v'aane, wasu'v'yaga magu'lu' gakwe ha wu'li'li', wakindi'laga myu'ye, wagulalaga, na walondaga nzi'la ya v'agu'ku' v'akwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.49.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.49.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
